<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Amosi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Amosi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amosi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Amo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMOSI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu ashi shana ulagilagi wa umbuyi wa Amosi, Amosi kaweriti mshungaji gwa kondolu (mu shipandi sha 1:1), viraa kaweriti mlimi. (Mu shipandi sha 7:14). Shakapanu Mlungu kamsyagula kuwera mbuyi gwakuyi, Amosi kalawiti mji gwa Tekoa gweni guweriti kusika mwa ufalumi wa Yuda, kumbiti ulagilagi wakuyi uvuwa upangitwi kuwera kwajili ya wantu yawalikaliti kushana mwa Israeli, Amosi katakuliti umbuyi awu shaka Uzia pakaweriti mfalumi gwa Yuda na Yeroboamu gwa pili pakaweriti mfalumi gwa Israeli ali liweriti mu shinja sha 750 pamberi pa Kristu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Amosi katungiti toza kwa wantu wa isi zivuwa muvipandi viwili vya kwanja, kumbiti ulagilagi wakuyi uvuwa uweriti kwajili ya wantu wa Israeli. Shaka sha mpatiru walyaluwiti kuusu Mlungu na kuwatendera madoda wahushu, mushipandi sha 2:6. Hangu toza ya Mlungu kwa womberi iweriti womberi watolwi muumanda 7:17. Ata hangu Mlungu kalongiti hakendereyi kuwatanga wantu wa Israeli wawakanki kayi wantu wa isi zimonga zeni ziwakolitimlima aku kumberi 9:12.</para>
  <para style="iot">YAGAWERAAMU</para>
  <para style="io">Amosi kankulimaniziya, mushipandi sha kwanja.</para>
  <para style="io">Amosi kankubwera toza kwa wantu wamonga, mushipandi sha 1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Amosi kankutakulira toza na kutolwa kwa Waisraeli kugenda muumanda, mushipandi sha 3-9:11.</para>
  <para style="io">Mlungu kankuwawuziya kayi Waisraeli mu isi yawu, mushipandi sha 9:12-15.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="AMO 1" />
  <para style="s">Toza kwa isi zimonga zya Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 1:1" />Avi ndo visoweru vya Amosi yumu gwa wachungaji wa wakanyama wa mji gwa Tekoa. Mlungu kamlanguziyiti Amosi mirandu yoseri ayi kuusu Israeli muvinja viwili pamberi pa lilendemeru lya isi, kayi shaka ashi Uziya kaweriti mfalumi gwa Yuda, Yereboamu mwana gwa Yoashi kaweriti mfalumi gwa Israeli. <verse eid="AMO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 1:2" />Amosi kalongiti hangu,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="AMO 1:2" />
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:2">“Mtuwa Mlungu kankuguguma kulawa lugongu lwa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:2">kaguguma kulawa Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:2">mpaka maliwuziwu ga washungaji gayuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 1:2">ntundu kulugongu Karimeli zyanguyuma.”<verse eid="AMO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankuyitoza Siriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 1:3" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, “Wantu wa Damesku watenda kayi vidoda, hangu, hapeninoyi kuwakomanga yawawatendera wantu wa Gileadi mirandu midoda. <verse eid="AMO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 1:4" />Su, hanilisulusiliri motu liboma lya mfalumi Hazaeli na hagulunguziyi nakamu maboma ga mfalumi Beni Hadadi. <verse eid="AMO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 1:5" />Hanigamegangi magomi ga Damesku na kuwatupula wenikaya wa lulalanda lya Aweni, pamuhera na mkolamlima gwa Beti Edeni. Wantu wa Aramu hawajegwi kuwuhamisiwu Kiri. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntakula.”<verse eid="AMO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankuwatoza wantu wa Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 1:6" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, “Wantu wa Gaza watenda kayi vidoda na hapanindeki kuwakomanga. Wawatola wamanda wantu wa likabila loseri, wawawuziti waweri wamanda kwa wantu wa Edomu.” <verse eid="AMO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 1:7" />Hangu hanivisulusiliri motu vibambaza vya mji gwa Gaza gweni hagulunguziwi nakamu maboma gakuyi. <verse eid="AMO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 1:8" />“Wenikaya wa Ashidodi haniwagamiziyi pamuhera na wakolamlima wa Ashikeloni. Haniwakomangi wa Ekroni na Wafilisti woseri yawasigaliti hawalaguwi. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntakula hangu.<verse eid="AMO 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankuwatoza wantu wa Tiru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 1:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, wantu wa Tiru wawera kayi na vidoda hangu hapeninoyi kuwakomanga. Toziya wawatoliti wantu waneni wa Israeli na kuwajegera Edomu, Waligalambuka lipatanu lya ugaja lyawaweriti walitenda.” <verse eid="AMO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 1:10" />Hanivijegeri motu vibambaza vya mji gwa Tiro, na kugalunguziya nakamu maboma gakuyi.<verse eid="AMO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankuwatoza wantu wa Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 1:11" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, “Wantu wa Edomu watenda kayi vidoda, hangu hapeninoyi kuwakomanga. Toziya wawawinga walongu wawu Waisraeli kwa magumba, pota lusungu na walekandiri kuwakomanga mala kwa mala na maya gawu gaweriti mashaka goseri.” <verse eid="AMO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 1:12" />Hangu hanigujegeri motu mji gwa Temani na kugalunguziya nakamu maboma ga Bosira.<verse eid="AMO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankuwatoza wantu wa Amoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 1:13" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, “Wantu wa Amoni watenda kayi makontola, hangu hapeninoyi kuwakomanga, toziya wawatumbuliti wadala yawana zinda muisi ya Gileadi, su kongera mbaka zawu.” <verse eid="AMO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 1:14" />Su, hanivijegeri motu vibambaza vya mji gwa Raba na kulunguziya nakamu maboma gakuyi. Shakapanu lishaka ali lya nkondu hapaweri na umatu mkulu na makomangu hagaweri makalipa handa lipuga. <verse eid="AMO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 1:15" />“Mfalumi gwawu na walonguziya wakuyi, woseri hawagendi kulikala muuhamisiwu. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntakula.”<verse eid="AMO 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="AMO 2" />
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankuwatoza wantu wa Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 2:1" />“Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, wantu wa Moabu watenda kayi vidoda, nakaka haniwakomangi. Toziya wapambiti mihonju ya mfalumi gwa Edomu, mpaka iwera livu.” <verse eid="AMO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 2:2" />Su hanjegi motu muisi ya Moabu na kugalunguziya nakamu maboma ga mji gwa Keriyoti. Wamashonta pawatenda umatu wa liziwu lya lipenka, wantu wa Moabu hawahowi kwa umatu awu wa nkondu. <verse eid="AMO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 2:3" />“Hanimlagi mkolamlima gwa Mowabu pamuhera na maafisa wakuyi woseri muisi ayi.<verse eid="AMO 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankuwatoza wantu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 2:4" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, wantu wa Yuda watenda kayi madoda, nakaka haniwakomangi, toziya walema lagiru zyangu pota kufata malagalira gangu. Wapotiziwa na wamlungu walawalii yawayitenderiti wambuyi wawu.” <verse eid="AMO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 2:5" />Hanjegi motu kuisi ya Yuda na kugalunguziya nakamu mboma ga Yerusalemu.<verse eid="AMO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankutoza wantu wa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 2:6" />“Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, wantu wa Israeli watenda kayi madoda, nakaka haniwakomangi, toziya wawawuza wantu yawana haki kwa mpiya na kuwashuwuza wantu waneni wahushu kwa kuwabadili kwa malapa.” <verse eid="AMO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 2:7" />Wawawonera yawahera makakala na wahushu wawabagula nawapata haki zawu. Mwana na tati gwakuyi wagonja na yaya yumu, hangu mlipananandiri ligoya litawu lyangu linanagala. <verse eid="AMO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 2:8" />Wagonjera pambwega mukila shitalawanda kwa nguwu zawatoliti kwa wahushu handa poni ya uwanda wawu na munumba ya mlungu gwawu walanda divayi yayihemilitwi kwa mpiya yazitozitwi kwa wawanda wawu.<verse eid="AMO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 2:9" />Hangu mwenga wantu wa neni, toziya ya mwenga niwagamiziyiti nakamu Waamori yawaweriti watali handa mierezi, wanamakakala handa mitera ya mialoni. Nakaka niziagamiziyiti ntambi na mishigira. <verse eid="AMO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 2:10" />Niwalaviya kulawa isi ya Misri, niwalongoziya kushiwala vinja arobayini na kuwapanana isi ya Waamoni. <verse eid="AMO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 2:11" />“Niwasyaguliti wamu wa wana wa mwenga waweri wambuyi na wamu wa wantemba wenu walilaviyi kwajili ya lihengu lya Mlungu. Hashi mwenga waisraeli, gantakula aga ganakakandiri? Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntakula.” <verse eid="AMO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 2:12" />Kumbiti muwatenditi Wantemba awa walandi divayi na kuwalagalira wambuyi nawalaviya umbuyi. <verse eid="AMO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 2:13" />Vinu su haniwaposholangi gambira mbutuka ntambu yayiposholanga, shaka imemiziwa viboga. <verse eid="AMO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 2:14" />Mtuga mgangamala hapeni kashapili, yawana makakala hawapeluwi makakala gawu na wanjagira hawasindi kugalopola makaliru gawu. <verse eid="AMO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 2:15" />Njagira yakaguma msali hakatugi, wanjagira yawatuga hapeni wawezi kushapira na mkwena farasi hapeni kalopoli makaliru gakuyi. <verse eid="AMO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 2:16" />“Lishaka ali ata mashonta wagangamala hawasi vikomangiru vyawu na kutuga. Ntakula neni Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="AMO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="AMO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 3:1" />Mwenga wantu wa Israeli mpikanili shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu shakakugambireni, mwenga wantu woseri yakawalaviyiti kulawa isi ya Misri, <verse eid="AMO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 3:2" />pakati pa wantu woseri, ndo mwenga gweka yenu yaniwasyaguliti, hangu haniwakomangi toziya ya makontola genu goseri.<verse eid="AMO 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu ga wambuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 3:3" />Hashi wantu wawili waweza kugendagenda pamuhera pota kujimirana uti?<verse eid="AMO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 3:4" />Hashi simba kaguguma kuntundu handa kenepati shakuwinga?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 3:4">Hashi mwana simba kaguguma kumbanga mwakuyi handa kenibati shintu?<verse eid="AMO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 3:5" />Hashi mgomiziwu guweza kufyatuka pota shintu?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 3:5">Hashi mgomiziwu guweza kufyatuka pota kushinkulwa na shintu?<verse eid="AMO 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 3:6" />Hashi lipenka lya mji liweza kulira pota kuwatenda wantu watiri?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 3:6">Mji guweza kuwera na ntabiku yayijegwandiri na Mtuwa Mlungu?<verse eid="AMO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 3:7" />Nakaka Mtuwa Mlungu hapeni katendi shintu shoseri pota kuwagubutulira bada wantumintumi wakuyi, wambuyi.<verse eid="AMO 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 3:8" />Simba pakaguguma gaa yakatirandiri?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 3:8">Mtuwa Mlungu pakayowera gaa hakalemi kuubwera ulagilagi wakuyi?<verse eid="AMO 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samariya yakwagamiziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 3:9" />“Mbweri kwa wantu yawalikala munumba ya mfalumi gwa Ashidodi na Misri. Mjojoniki kumigongu yayizyengeta isi ya Samariya, mwakaliwoneri magaziwu makulu yagawera amu na kwonerwa kwa wantu wakuyi.<verse eid="AMO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 3:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, wantu yawamemiziya numba zyawu vintu vya kwiwa na kupoka. Viraa wavimanandiri kutenda yagalinganira! <verse eid="AMO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 3:11" />Hangu wakondu hawizi na kuwakankala, hawahalibisiyi pahala pawu pa liboma na kuzilopola numba zawu.<verse eid="AMO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 3:12" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, gambira mshungaji ntambu yakampoka simba kumlomu magulu mawili hera ama shipandi sha likutu lya kondolu, ndo ntambu yanawaponeki Waisraeli wadidini hera yawalikala Samariya pamuhera na shipandi sha shitanda ama shipandi sha shuka. <verse eid="AMO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 3:13" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwa mashonta kalonga hangu, Mpikanili na mwakawakalipili wiwuka wa Yakobo.” <verse eid="AMO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 3:14" />Lishaka ali haniwakomanga Waisraeli toziya ya makosa gawu, hahalibisiyi viraa shitalawanda sha mji gwa Beteli. Hanigakatangi magoli ga kila shitalawanda na kugagusiya pasi. <verse eid="AMO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 3:15" />“Hanizihalibisiyi numba za shaka sha mpepu, pamuhera na numba za shaka sha jotu, viravilii hanizibomoli numba zawu nkulu ziherepa zazilembiziliwitwi kwa magoli ga ntembu. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu katakula.”<verse eid="AMO 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="AMO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 4:1" />Mpikanili shisoweru ashi, mwenga wadala yamuwera handa ng'ombi wa Bashani yamlikala kulugongu lwa Samariya, mwenga mwanguwawonera yawahera uwezu na wahushu na kwendeleya kuwagambira wapalu wenu, mutujegeri divai tulandi. <verse eid="AMO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 4:2" />Neni Mtuwa Mlungu mnanagala nilirapa, “Nakaka mashaka gakwiza, wankondu wenu hawawakomangi gambira ndowani ntambu yazilopola wasomba. <verse eid="AMO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 4:3" />Mwenga hamgendi mpaka pahala papabomolitwi mushibambaza na kukwegwera kunja na kuwajega Harimoni.”<verse eid="AMO 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisraeli walema kumpikanira Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 4:4" />Mwenga Israeli, mgendi aku Beteli mwakatendi vidoda! Mgendi Giligali mwakongeri kutenda vidoda! Mlaviyi matambiku genu kila mandawira na lifungu lya kumi kila lishaka lya tatu. <verse eid="AMO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 4:5" />“Moshiyi mkati lyalilekerwandiri simika handa kulonga mayagashii, Mlizyumi poseri handa mlaviya kwa kufira maweni, toziya mwenga ndo ntambu yamfira kutenda! Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntakula.<verse eid="AMO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 4:6" />Niwapananiti njala mu kira mji na kupunguluwa shiboga kila mji. Hangu mmbuyirandiri. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntakula.” <verse eid="AMO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 4:7" />Kayi niwimiti mvula, shaka vimeru vyenu pavifiriti mvula nentu. Nigutowiliti mvula mji gumu na mji gumonga nigutowerandiri. Lirambu limu lilipatiti mvula na limonga lipatitindiri liyumi. <verse eid="AMO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 4:8" />“Wantu wa miji miwili ama mitatu watugira mji gumonga, su wapati mashi, kumbiti wapatandiri. Ata hangu mmbuyirandiri. Ntakula neni Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="AMO 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 4:9" />Mara zivuwa nizikomangiti viwunga vyenu na malambu genu ga mizabibu na njegiti lyega lyanalivuki na kuyumiziya viboga vyenu. Wanjombi wamemeniti tini zyenu na mitera ya mizeyituni. Kumbiti mmbuyirandiri. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntakula.<verse eid="AMO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 4:10" />Niwajegeriti ulweri ukalipa nentu handa ulii yaniwujegeriti Misri. Niwalaga wantemba wenu munkondu, niwatoliti farasi wenu wa nkondu. Mauti gamemiti mumalingu genu na kununka kwakuyi kumema mumpula zyenu. Kumbiti mmbuyirandiri. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntakula.<verse eid="AMO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 4:11" />Wamonga wenu niwalagiti gambila wantu wa Sodoma na Gomora. Walii yawaponikiti muwamu mwenu, waweriti handa shizinga sha motu. Kumbiti mmbuyirandiri. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntakula.<verse eid="AMO 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 4:12" />Hangu, mwenga wantu wa Israeli haniwakomangi. Toziya hantendi mlandu agu, mweri kala kwa toza ya neni!”<verse eid="AMO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 4:13" />Mlungu ndo yakanyawiti lugongu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">na kuwumba liyega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">ndo yakammaniziya muntu maholu gakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">ndo yakagalambuliti paluwala kuwera pashiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">na kutimbanga mpeleru zya pasipanu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">Mtuwa Mlungu yakana makakala ndo litawu lyakuyi!<verse eid="AMO 4:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="AMO 5" />
  <para style="s">Amosi kankuhinginika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 5:1" />Mpikanili ntambu yandaya kwajili ya mwenga wantu wa Israeli.<verse eid="AMO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 5:2" />“Mwenga wantu wa Israeli mguwa na hapeni mgoloki kayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:2">mlekwa gweka muisi mwenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:2">kwahera ata muntu gwa kukunyasula.”<verse eid="AMO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 5:3" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, “Mji gumu hagulagaliri wamashonta elufu yimu kugenda kulikomanga kumbiti hawawuyi wamashonta miyayimu hera na mji gumonga hagulagaliri wamashonta miya yimu kumbiti hawaponeki wamashonta kumi hera.”<verse eid="AMO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 5:4" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambira hangu wantu wa Israeli, “Munsakuli na mwenga hamwendeleyi kulikala! <verse eid="AMO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 5:5" />Kumbiti namunsakula Beteli pota namgenda Giligali, pota namloka Beeri Sheba. Mana wenikaya wa Gilgali nakaka hawatorwi muuhamisiwu na Beteli hayiyagamiziwi!”<verse eid="AMO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 5:6" />Mumsakuli Mtuwa Mlungu na mwenga hamwendeleyi kulikala! Hera hangu, hakawangamiziyi wiwuka wa Yosefu handa motu. Motu haguwalunguziyi wenikaya wa beteli na kwahera muntu yakaweza kuguzimiya. <verse eid="AMO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 5:7" />Mliloliweri mwenga yamgalambula haki kuwera utama na kutenda mirandu yayifiruwa shintundiri.<verse eid="AMO 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 5:8" />Ayu yakatenditi vipinga vya ntondu zyazishemwa Kilimiya na Oriyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">yakagalambula</para>
  <para style="b" vid="AMO 5:8" />
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">luwidu kuwera paliwala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">na paliwala kuwera pashiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">yomberi kagashema mashi ga bahari gaweri pamuhera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">na kugayita kumpindi pa isi iyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">Mtuwa Mlungu ndo litawu lyakuyi.<verse eid="AMO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 5:9" />Mweni ndo yakawalaga yawana makakala na kugahalibisiya maboma gawu.<verse eid="AMO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 5:10" />Mwenga mwankuwakalalira yawakomangira haki na kumbeziya ulii yakatakula nakaka. <verse eid="AMO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 5:11" />Mwenga mwankuwayonera wahushu na muwashonga wawapanani seemu nkulu ya shirii shawabenangiti. Tembera mwankulinyawira numba zya mabuwi ga kusongola, kumbiti mwenga hapeni mlikali amu, mwankulima malambu gaherepa ga mizabibu, kumbiti hapeni mlandi divayi yakuyi. <verse eid="AMO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 5:12" />Mana neni nivimana uvuwa wa makontola genu na ukulu wa vidoda vyenu, mwenga muwatabisiya wantu waheri na mtola swinda na kulewelera wahushu nawapata haki kumahakama. <verse eid="AMO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 5:13" />Mushaka handa ashi muntu yakana luhala hakanyamalijii, toziya shaka ashi ndo shidoda.<verse eid="AMO 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 5:14" />Msakuli kutenda yagawera maheri pota namtenda makontola, su Mtuwa Mlungu yakana makakala yamlonga kapamuhera na mwenga kaweri nakaka na mwenga ntambu yamtakula. <verse eid="AMO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 5:15" />Mukalalili makontola na mtendi haki mumahakama. Pamonga Mtuwa Mlungu yakana makakala hakawawoneri lusungu wantu wa Yosefu yawasigaliti.<verse eid="AMO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 5:16" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu, “Mlungu yakana makakala kalonga hangu, hapaweli na shiwembu kila pahala mumitaa, wantu hawadayi munjira zoseri na kulira kwa utama munjira nkulu. Yawalima hawashemwi wizi kulira na yawalipwa kwa kudaya hawashemwi su wizi kudaya. <verse eid="AMO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 5:17" />Hapaweri na kudaya mumalambu goseri ga mizabibu, mana hampiti pakati penu kuwakomanga. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntakula.”<verse eid="AMO 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="AMO 5:18" />Shondi mwenga yamuhepera kwa nfiru lishaka lya Mtuwa Mlungu! Ntambu gaa mlifira nentu lishaka ali? Lishaka ali haliweri lya luwindu na kwahera kulangala! <verse eid="AMO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="AMO 5:19" />Hayiweri gambira muntu yakamtira simba shakapanu kaliwona na kanyama yakashemwa dubu! Ama handa muntu yakawuya ukaya kwakuyi na kulitula liwoku lyakuyi mushibambaza na kulumwa na njoka! <verse eid="AMO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="AMO 5:20" />Lishaka lya Mtuwa Mlungu haliweri luwindu na hapeni kuweri na kulangala, haliweri dunyu pota kuwera kulangala koseri.<verse eid="AMO 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="AMO 5:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu kolonga hangu, nkalalira na kubeziya misambu yenu ya kunguwira, nikusekelerandiri kujojonika kwenu kwa kuguwira. <verse eid="AMO 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="AMO 5:22" />Pamndaviliraku tambiku zyenu zya kulunguziwa na zya ubumu, neni hapeni njimili kuzyanka na tambiku zyenu zya ponga zya wankanyama yawanenipiti neni hapeni niziloli nakamu. <verse eid="AMO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="AMO 5:23" />Mumbusiliri umatu wa nyimbu zyenu! Nfirandiri kupikanira lwimbu lwa vingutinguti vyenu! <verse eid="AMO 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="AMO 5:24" />Kumbiti mtendi mirandu miheri yayifiruwa na mirandu ayi miheri nayipela ila iweri handa mashi yaganyililiki.<verse eid="AMO 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="AMO 5:25" />Mwenga numba ya Israeli, hashi munjegeliti ata mara yimu tambiku na malaviwu pamuweriti kushiwala vinja arubaini? <verse eid="AMO 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="AMO 5:26" />Shaka shirii mpapitindiri vinyagu vya mfalumi gwenu, Sakuti mlungu gwenu mkolamlima na Kayiwani mlungu gwenu ntondu, weni muwanyawiti maweni. Kumbiti vinu hamvipapi vinyagu avi. <verse eid="AMO 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="AMO 5:27" />Toziya ayi haniwajegeri muuhamisiwu, “Kutali kuliku Damesku, aga kalonga Mtuwa Mlungu, mweni litawu lyakuyi ndo Mlungu yakana makakala goseri.”<verse eid="AMO 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="AMO 6" />
  <para style="s">Kukomangwa kwa wantu wa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 6:1" />Amshiwoni mwenga yamunemelera na kwikuta mu Sayuni na yamulikala poneka kumigongu Samariya! Mwenga yamuliwona handa walonguziya wamanika muisi yayimanika. <verse eid="AMO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 6:2" />Mgendi mpaka mji gwa Kaline mwakaloli kila pahala na mlawi mgendi mpaka mji mkulu gwa Hamati, shakapanu msuluki mpaka mji gwa Gati kwa Wafilisti. Hashi falumi zyawu zyana makakala kuliku falumi zyenu na isi yawu ndo nkulu kuliku yenu? <verse eid="AMO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 6:3" />Mwenga mlema kujimira handa lishaka lya ntabiku lyankwiza. Kumbiti kwa kutenda hangu mtenda lishaka ali liweri lya pakwegera. <verse eid="AMO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 6:4" />Hamshiwoni mwenga yamgonja muvitanda vyavilembitwi na magoli ga ntembu na mlitalipisiya pampindi pa makochi, pamliya vinofu vya kondolu na ng'ombi wadidika. <verse eid="AMO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 6:5" />Mwenga mfira kwimba vuluvulu na liziwu lya vinubi, na kutunga nyimbu ya syayi handa mfalumi Dawudi. <verse eid="AMO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 6:6" />Mwankulanda divayi mumabakuli na kulipakaziya utuli uherepa nentu. Kumbiti mudayandiri kwa kulaguwa kwa wiwuka wa Yosefu. <verse eid="AMO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 6:7" />Hangu hamuweri wa kwanja kujegerwa muuhamisiwu na misambu yenu ya kulinemiziya hayagamili.<verse eid="AMO 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 6:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalilapira mweni, “Mlungu Yakana Makakala kalilapira mweni pakalonga, nkalaziwa nentu na kulitumba kwa wiwuka wa Yakobo, kayi nkaliziwa na nyumba zyawu ziherepa. Mji gwawu na vyoseri vyaviweriti haniwapanani wankondu wawu.”<verse eid="AMO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 6:9" />Payiwera wantu lilongu hawasigali munumba yimu womberi hawahowi. <verse eid="AMO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 6:10" />Pakizaku mlongu gwa yakahowiti kugalaviya mauti kunja su kagapambili,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 6:10">na pakakosiya, “Hashi kwana muntu yoseri mungati amu yakalififa, nakwana muntu gwingi pamuhera na gwenga?” Na yomberi hakamwankuli,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 6:10">“Kwahera!” Shakapanu mlongu uliya hakamgambili, “Gunyamaliri! Natulikanta litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="AMO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 6:11" />Guloli Mtuwa Mlungu pakalagalira wankondu hawazibomoli numba nkulu na ndidini vipandivipandi vididini. <verse eid="AMO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 6:12" />Hashi, farasi kaweza kutuga mumatalabuyi? Na wantu waweza kuyilima bahari kwa ligembi lya ng'ombi? Kumbiti mwenga muyigalambula lagiru kuwera usungu na yagawera maheri kuwera madoda.<verse eid="AMO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 6:13" />Mwenga mwankulitumba kugulopola mji gwa Lo Debari. Na kulonga, “Tuyipata Karinayimu kwa makakala getu”<verse eid="AMO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 6:14" />Mtuwa Mlungu yakana makakala goseri kalonga, “Mwenga wantu wa Israeli nakaka haniwalagaliri wantu wa isi yimonga iwakomangi na hayiwatabisiyi mwenga kwanjira Lebo Hamati yayiwera kushana, mpaka lushemba lya Araba uwega wa kusika.”<verse eid="AMO 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="AMO 7" />
  <para style="s">Malola ga Wanjombi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 7:1" />Ali ndo lyakanangaziyi Mtuwa Mlungu. Kaweriti kankutanda vipinga vya wanjombi pawabenitikala lifungu lya mfalumi na shaka shili vimeru paviweriti vyakwanja kutomola. <verse eid="AMO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 7:2" />Niwawoniti wanjombi wankuliya na kumalira ntundu yoseri muisi. Shakapanu ndiliti na kulonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu nikuluwa gutuwoneri lusungu! Wiwuka wa Yakobo hawawezi hashi kulikala? Guloli womberi ndo wadidini nentu na wanyongi!”<verse eid="AMO 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 7:3" />Hangu Mtuwa Mlungu kagalambula nfiru yakuyi na kalonga, “Hapeni ntendi hangu!”<verse eid="AMO 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malola ga Motu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 7:4" />Ali ndo lyankananguziyiti kayi Mtuwa Mlungu. Nimwoniti Mtuwa Mlungu kankuwatoza wantu kwa motu. Motu agu gulunguziyiti matiwa makulu ga bahali na gulunguziyiti isi iyuma. <verse eid="AMO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 7:5" />Shakapanu ntakula. “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu nikuluwa guleki kukomanga! Wiwuka wa Yakobo hawawezi ashi kulikala? Womberi ndo wadidini nentu na wanyongi!” <verse eid="AMO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 7:6" />Hangu Mtuwa Mlungu kagalambula nfiru yakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:6">kalonga, “Ali viraa hapeni lilawiri.”<verse eid="AMO 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malola ga Biriji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 7:7" />Ali ndo lyakananguziyi kayi Mtuwa Mlungu. Nimwoniti Mtuwa Mlungu kagoloka pakwegera na shibambaza, mumawoku mwakuyi kabata shintu shizotopa su kashipimi shibambaza kawoni handa shinyosheka. <verse eid="AMO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 7:8" />Mtuwa kankosiya, Amosi guwona shishi? Nimwakula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 7:8">“Niwuwona ubunta wa biriji.” Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:8">Guloli! Ntula biriji iwapimi wantu toziya womberi ndo handa shibambaza shashipinditi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 7:8">Hangu hapeni hepeleri kayi makontola gawu. <verse eid="AMO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 7:9" />“Pahala pampindi pavigongu kweni wiwuka wa Isaka watambikira, hapahalibisiwu na pahala pa kulikala Waisraeli hapaweri mahami. Hanilukomangi kwa nkondu lukolu lwa mfalumi Yeroboamu.”<verse eid="AMO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amosi na Amazia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 7:10" />“Shakapanu Amazia yakaweriti mtambika gwa mji gwa Betheli kalagaliriti ulagilagi kwa mfalumi Yeroboamu gwa Israeli pakalonga, Amosi kankukuvuluvutira gwenga muisi ya Israeli. Wantu hapeniwakupikaniri kayi gwenga. <verse eid="AMO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 7:11" />Toziya yomberi katakula, Yeroboamu hakahowi kwa nkondu na wantu wa Israeli hawajegwi muwuhamisiwu, kutali nakamu na isi yawu.<verse eid="AMO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 7:12" />Shakapanu Amazia kamgambira Amosi, guwuki na umbuyi waku! Gugendi muisi ya Yuda gwakalaviyi umbuyi waku na wantu wa aku hawakupanani shiboga. <verse eid="AMO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 7:13" />Nagulaviya kayi umbuyi panu Beteli toziya pahala panu ndo pahala pa kuguwira mfalumi, kayi ndo numba ya mfalumi.”<verse eid="AMO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 7:14" />“Amosi kamwakula Amaziya pakalonga, neni nambuyindiri gwashibena mgongu, kumbiti neni ndo mshungaji gwa kondolu na mlolera mikuyu. <verse eid="AMO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 7:15" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kambusiyiti mlihengu ali lya ushungaji kondolu na kandagalira nizi kuwagambira umbuyi wantu wakuyi wa Israeli. <verse eid="AMO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 7:16" />Vinu Amaziya, gupikanili shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu. Gwenga gung'ambira nandaviya umbuyi kwa wantu wa Israeli, pota kubwera kwa wiwuka wa Isaka. <verse eid="AMO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 7:17" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, mdala gwaku hakaweri mhumba mumji na wana waku wapalu na wadala hawalaguwi munkondu. Isi yaku hayibagulwi na kupananwa wamonga na gwenga haguhoweli muisi ya uhamisiwu na wantu wa Israeli hawajegwi muwuhamisiwu, kutali nakamu na isi yawu.”<verse eid="AMO 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="AMO 8" />
  <para style="s">Malola ga Shikapu sha mabwajubwaju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 8:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kananguziya malola gamonga, Moniti shikapu shashimemiti mabwajubwaju gawula. <verse eid="AMO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 8:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu kankosiya. “Amosi guwona shishi? Naneni nimwakula, nishiwona shikapu sha mabwajubaju gawula. Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambira, upeleru wa wantu waneni wa Israeli usoka. Hapeni hepeleri ukontola wawu. <verse eid="AMO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 8:3" />Lishaka ali nyimbu zya Numba ya Mlungu nanagala hazigalambulwi kuwera madaya. Hakuweri na mauti gavuwa na geni hagaswi kila pahala na kila muntu hakanyamali jii.”<verse eid="AMO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankuyitabisiya Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 8:4" />Mpikanili mwenga yamuwayonera wanyongi na yamuwatendera vidoda wahushu muisi. <verse eid="AMO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 8:5" />Mlitakulira maweni, msambu gwa mwezi kulawa hagupeli ndii su twanji kushuwuza viboga vyetu? Lishaka lya Kwoyela haliperi ndii su tushuwuzi nganu yetu? Hatupunguli vipimu na kukweniziya beyi, hatuzyangi wantu kwa mizani yayilinganirandiri, <verse eid="AMO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 8:6" />matimba ga nganu na patuwahemela wahushu kwa mpiya na yawahera shintu kwa vilwatu.<verse eid="AMO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 8:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga, “Tembera mwenga mwankulitumba kuwera wiwuka wa Yakobo, nakaka, hapeni nilyaluwi matendu ganu makontola.” <verse eid="AMO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 8:8" />Toziya ayi pasipanu hapalendemeli na kila muntu muisi hakadayi. Isi yoseri hayiwegukiweguki, hayikweni na kusuluka gambira mashi ga lushemba Naili! <verse eid="AMO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 8:9" />“Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga, lishaka ali hanigutendi mshenji guzyeti saa sita na isi hayiweri luwindu paluwala.” <verse eid="AMO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 8:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangalambuli misambu yenu kuwera kudaya na kwimba kwenu kuweri kulira. Haniwatendi woseri mwenga mvali nguwu zya maguniya na kumoga shikubuli mumituwi yenu, handa kudaya kwa kuhowa kwa mwana gwa gweka. Na lishaka lya upeleru haliweri lya utama mkulu.<verse eid="AMO 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 8:11" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, “Mashaka gakwiza geni hanjegi njala muisi. Kumbiti njalandiri ya kwahera shiboga ama kwimuluwa mashi, ila njala ya kupikanira shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="AMO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 8:12" />Wantu hawatyangityangi kulawa bahali mpaka bahali, kulawa uwega wa kushana mpaka kwagulawa mshenji. Hawatugili aku na aku pawasakula shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu, kumbiti hapeni wapati. <verse eid="AMO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 8:13" />Mlishaka ali, wantemba na wahinga waherepa hawazimiyi kwa kwimuluwa mashi. <verse eid="AMO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 8:14" />Walii yawalirapa kwa wamlungu wa mpayu wa Samariya na kulonga, “Kwa litawu lya mlungu gwa Dani ama kwa litawu lya mlungu gwa Beeri Sheba, woseri hawaguwi na hapeni wagoloki kayi.”<verse eid="AMO 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="AMO 9" />
  <para style="s">Mtuwa Mlungu kankutoza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 9:1" />“Nimwoniti Mtuwa Mlungu kagoloka pambwega pa shitalawanda na yomberi kandagalira pakalonga, gukomi pampindi pa mpanda za numba ya Mlungu Mnanagala mpaka miyanjiru yakuyi itikinyiki. Guzimegi mpanda azi, su shitwiku shiwaguwiri wantu mumituyi mpaka wahowi. Walii yawasigala haniwalagi kwa nkondu, kwahera ata yumu gwawu hakaponeki, kwahera yanakatoloki.” <verse eid="AMO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 9:2" />Ata pawalibawira njira ya kugenda kwa wantu yawahowiti, kulawa aku haniwatoli kwa liwoku lyangu, pawakwena kumpindi, haniwasulusiyi pasi. <verse eid="AMO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 9:3" />Handa pawalififa pawupeleru palugongu Karimeli, haniwasakuli aku na kuwatola, handa pawalififa kumashi matali ga bahari, aku hantagaliri njoka songu kawalumi. <verse eid="AMO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 9:4" />Ata pawatolwa kwa makakala na wankondu wawu, aku haniwatendi walaguwi ku nkondu. Haniwatenderi madoda kumbiti maherindiri.<verse eid="AMO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 9:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu yakana makakala, kashinkula pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:5">na peni palendemera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:5">na wenikaya wakuyi wankudaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:5">pasipanu poseri pankukwena na kusuluka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:5">handa kumema na kusera kwa lushemba Naili lwa Misri.<verse eid="AMO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 9:6" />Mtuwa Mlungu kanyawa numba yakuyi ya shifalumi kumpindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:6">na kutula miyanjiru yakuyi pasipanu, yomberi kagashema mashi ga bahari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:6">na kugayita pampindi paisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:6">Mtuwa Mlungu ndo litawu lyakuyi!<verse eid="AMO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 9:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, “Kwaneni mwenga wantu wa Israeli niwaholera ntambu yaniwaholeriti wantu wa mji gwa Kushi! Ntambu yaniwalaviyiti Waisraeli kulawa mji gwa Misri. <verse eid="AMO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 9:8" />Nakaka masu ga Mtuwa Mlungu galola ufalumi yawana vidoda. Naneni haniwuwagamiziyi kulawa sheni sha pasipanu. Hangu hapeni niwuwagamiziyi wiwuka wa Yakobo.”<verse eid="AMO 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 9:9" />Mana handagaliri na kuwapeta wantu wa Israeli yawawera muisi zimonga, handa muntu yakapeta viboga, su kuwusiya ushafu na kutenda ata mbeyu yimu nayituluka. <verse eid="AMO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 9:10" />“Yawana vidoda muwamu mwa wantu waneni, hawahoweri munkondu, awa ndo yawatakula, matenduwa hapeni gatwiziri pota kutupata.”<verse eid="AMO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankuwera na makakala kayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 9:11" />Lishaka lyakwiza haniwutendi uweri na makakala kayi ufalumi wa Dawudi, gambira numba yayinyawitwi. Hanimtendi kayi ntambu yakaweriti makashu. <verse eid="AMO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 9:12" />“Su wantu wa Israeli hawawakolimlima wantu yawasigaliti wa Edomu na isi zimonga zoseri yaziweriti zyangu. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntakula na hantendi hangu.<verse eid="AMO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 9:13" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga shaka shankwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">pamberi pa kubenanga na mabenangu hagaweri kala kubenangwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">katepu pahala pa kuyala zabibu hashifati shaka sha kubenanga zabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">Migongu hayibwituli divayi yasyayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">na vigongu havinyililiki divayi.”<verse eid="AMO 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 9:14" />Hanyawi kayi ntambu ya wantu waneni Waisraeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:14">Hawanyawi miji yawu yayihalibisiwitwi na kulikala amu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:14">Hawayali mizabibu na kulanda divayi yakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:14">hawalimi bostani na kuliya mabwajubwaju gakuyi.<verse eid="AMO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 9:15" />“Haniwatendi wantu waneni Israeli walikali muisi yawu weni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:15">hapeni wawusiwi kayi kulawa muisi yaniwapananiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:15">Ntakula neni Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="AMO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 9" />
</usx>